# MTK/Lenovo vendor property type declarations for TB375FC.
#
# These vendor_property_type types are set and read by the from-source vendor
# policy (sepolicy/vendor_mtk_prebuilt/mtk_proprietary.te). They are declared in
# the vendor sepolicy, not plat-private: under Treble the vendor policy cannot
# reference a plat-private type, so declaring them in plat forced clean_decompile
# to drop every vendor get_prop/set_prop grant that names them. Keeping them in
# this BOARD_VENDOR_SEPOLICY_DIR makes those grants compilable, matching how stock
# TB375FC ships them in vendor_sepolicy.cil.
#
# Originally generated from the stock TB375FC vendor_sepolicy.cil prop type set.

